  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T J.201 is intended to harmonize the application environment for declarative content for interactive television. It specifies common elements, media types and APIs at the syntactic level of the declarative application environment. This edition includes enhancements of broadcast markup language (BML) to provide functionalities for some scenarios of integrated broadcast-broadband (IBB) digital television (DTV) services.</abstract>
